# Cargo build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# cargo-mutants
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/

# Coverage
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Cargo.lock IS committed. This package ships a binary as well as a
# library, which is the case Cargo's own guidance says to commit it for,
# and it makes CI reproducible. Dependents are unaffected either way -
# Cargo ignores a dependency's lockfile. The cost is that a
# semver-compatible upgrade no longer reaches CI on its own; Dependabot
# (.github/dependabot.yml) is what covers that.

# env file
.env

# Local working notes and scratch reference material, not meant to be
# committed.
NOTES.md

# Claude Code. .claude/settings.json IS committed - it carries the
# project's shared permission allowlist. Anything personal or
# machine-specific belongs in settings.local.json instead, so that
# absolute paths and one-off approvals never reach the repository.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

.DS_Store
